  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Creating a Filter with CHAT\r\n\r\n**Context**: You are building a *Lost-and-Found Finder* to help people recover missing items. You need a filter that narrows down the list based on where the item was lost, when it was found, and what color it is.\r\n\r\n### Clarify\r\nIn `CHAT-Prompt.md`, decompose the type of filters that you might need to build for this lost and found app.\r\n\r\n### 2. Hone\r\nUse AI Tutor to assist with writing the helper functions necessary to implement the filters.\r\n\r\n### 3. Apply\r\nImplement your solution into the code and test its functionality. Have AI Tutor assist with creating test cases to make sure that all of your data is being filtered properly.\r\n\r\n### 4. Transfer\r\nCreate a generalized prompt to implement a simple filter into future work. Save it into the backpack.\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "allowMultipleAttempts": false,
      "placeholderText": "",
      "multipleChoiceOptions": [
